# Direct dependencies of the MCP servers image (work-order steps 1.4/1.5).
# Lock generated with pip-compile: requirements-mcp.lock.
# Pins kept in sync with versions.env (MCP_VERSION, DUCKDB_VERSION) and with
# requirements-worker-fast.lock (redis client used by mcp-jobs).
